OL,3,GNEWSAWildfire 'overlooked' as it was in
OL,4,Athe North - MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "huge and devastating" wildfire in
OL,7,Fthe North York Moors last year was
OL,8,F"overlooked" by the government and
OL,9,Fnational media because it was in the
OL,10,Fnorth of England, a Labour MP has said.
OL,12,FAlison Hume's Scarborough and Whitby
OL,13,Fconstituency includes the 10 sq mile
OL,14,F(25 sq km) area of Langdale Moor which
OL,15,Fwas ravaged by a fire which burned for
OL,16,Fmore than 40 days.
OL,18,F"There was very little interest from
OL,19,Fthe national media," she said, adding
OL,20,Fthat in recent weeks there had been
OL,21,F"smaller wildfires in the South that
OL,22,Freceived a lot of coverage".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
