OL,3,GNEWSAWildfire 'overlooked' as it was in
OL,4,Athe North - MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said it was "supporting
OL,7,Fevery part of the country that has been
OL,8,Faffected by wildfire - not just the
OL,9,FSouth".
